  "details": "When changing an avatar, modifying the pose causes the Tracking Control for all avatars used by the player to be incorrectly assigned.\n\nAttached is a video demonstrating the issue: \n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wWZs3PQU13Y\n\n1. At the start of the video, the bug is already present.\n\nEven after changing to a different avatar or using the Reset Avatar menu, the Tracking Control remains in an abnormal state.\n\nThe Debug window does not show any issues.\n\n2. At 00:24, the VRC Station function is used to reassign the Tracking Control.\n\n-> Once the Tracking Control is reassigned, the pose returns to normal.\n\n3. From 00:24 to 00:52, changing avatars does not reproduce the issue.\n\nHowever, from 00:52 to 00:54, when changing the avatar, the Tracking Control bug reappears.\n\n* All other players are experiencing the same issue as well.\n\nPlease look into this.",
